  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-9iCPiNfx\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wckewGPm\">使用SPI服务，需要提供一个回调地址，用于接收订阅推送的消息内容</p></blockquote><div class=\"qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-EsQTSObT%5C%22%3E%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%E6%8F%8F%E8%BF%B0%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BB%85%E4%B8%BA%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%E6%97%B6%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E7%9A%84%E5%BA%94%E7%AD%94%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%81%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Fdoc%2Findex.html%3Fkey%3Dad%26amp%3Btype%3Dapi%26amp%3Bid%3D1722468664901647%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8B%E3%80%90%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E3%80%91%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sgUj6%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EsQTSObT\">当前文档描述结构仅为创建订阅时验证回调地址时，系统要求的应答结构，实际订阅服务推送回调的数据格式可参考<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad&amp;type=api&amp;id=1722468664901647\" target=\"_blank\">【订阅服务类型】</a></p></div></div></div><h1 id=\"link-0\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-3AL6Zxmg\">支持的通信协议</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-mIjzM69L\"><strong>HTTP/HTTPS 协议</strong></p><h1 id=\"link-1\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-jrHd3PGY\">请求方式</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-5HrOejMD\"><strong>GET/POST</strong>&nbsp;回调地址需要同时支持GET和POST请求</p><h1 id=\"link-2\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-kUSQ7Xuc\">Challenge 验证</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-ALrQAsQD\">创建订阅任务填写回调地址时，系统会发送challenge挑战，验证URL的归属，请求参数如下</p><h2 id=\"link-3\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-Ybru6BjT\">请求参数</h2><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-id=\"t844fe7d-YGLjTtEA\" data-custom=\"false\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-hjhjLLE5\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c0ddd087-89t5pchm\" width=\"293%\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c0ddd087-w1RGmZee\" width=\"293%\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c0ddd087-6rUJCDNi\" width=\"293%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-7jItjtJD\"><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-ZdYy5agL\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t54b56e0-t7pcIrZs\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2i6jIhBv\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t54b56e0-6vYmhu4c\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yBKYcyWO\">类型</p></td><td data-id=\"tfafd194-WruFXmPh\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dVUO42RM\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-pRGVi3t1\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-vgdcEPzc\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gkezGmFo\">challenge</p></td><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-yJKRn3QI\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PAWCofdJ\">number</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t06eb8d1-PJVcj2iw\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5lkLRvJV\">随机数</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-nTcR51dP\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t114fa75-LnFpCheZ\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6zbej1iR\">event</p></td><td data-id=\"t114fa75-wTWNsA6v\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PBawXtyQ\">string</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb2db1b9-tMENdmwX\" class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6fkgzSao\">事件值，<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">verify_webhook</code>为Challenge验证事件</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 id=\"link-4\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-dPlV7bdd\">应答参数</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-JQitabVq\">在收到Challeng请求后，需要按照下述格式返回应答，要求response 的&nbsp;<strong>Content-Type 为 application/json</strong></p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-id=\"t844fe7d-PXLz6RAI\" data-custom=\"false\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-dzkYRlQF\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c0ddd087-2eTuaKrA\" width=\"293%\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c0ddd087-wpPm3jD3\" width=\"293%\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c0ddd087-3VJidNdi\" width=\"293%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-jp2ZxCIu\"><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-T0Vw92pv\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t54b56e0-zwKRMsJX\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3ehDlZip\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t54b56e0-5z3nK97T\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EcHUmSCd\">类型</p></td><td data-id=\"tfafd194-GUMVqa4s\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4pEtOyqc\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-IaCNr8X9\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-RGmEgCoy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bSVXLD9p\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\"></span>BaseResp</p></td><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-QjUEn3Uo\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FbLrHlli\">object</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t06eb8d1-4H5MscmZ\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GjJsuK1j\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-ta7uAz2j\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-u48XgwFo\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GPbdO2cp\"><span data-level=\"1\" class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-1\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A1%2C%22id%22%3A%22V2Sh6%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\">&nbsp;</span>StatusCode</p></td><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-Qnhj3yvh\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-q6XjpIhJ\">number</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t06eb8d1-rVgAxOQS\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Bo7CKLk9\">执行状态码，200表示成功，4xx 业务异常不重试，5xx 系统异常重试</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-d8KzisXs\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-aLgDDKAN\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dGaBbieA\"><span data-level=\"1\" class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-1\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A1%2C%22id%22%3A%22U09MG%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\">&nbsp;</span>StatusMessage</p></td><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-AUVZXC7r\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-aniZ6Ky5\">string</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t06eb8d1-mMOGhrvm\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EIYMXg84\">执行结果</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-Viyat29g\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t114fa75-GcpZNaZp\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bOoqjdpG\">challenge</p></td><td data-id=\"t114fa75-XT8NvfSK\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dUEiOli4\">number</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb2db1b9-WazHBOVp\" class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-McwucJIv\">回传请求中的challenge值</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 id=\"link-5\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-6jor0E6O\">应答示例</h2><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22BaseResp%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22StatusCode%5C%22%3A%20200%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22StatusMessage%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22ok%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22challenge%5C%22%3A%201%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w1abm%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 300px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content json\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-4Dcma4E5\"><br></p></div>",
